StyleMart on the classroom server (port 8500)
1.	Copy the workshop clone to:
C:\ColdFusion2025\cfusion\wwwroot\CFSummit2026Workshop
2.	Paste the OpenAI key into that copy:
StyleMart\config\openai-key.cfm
Replace paste-the-key-here. Save. 






http://localhost:8500/CFSummit2026Workshop/StyleMart/setup/finish-workshop-setup.cfm
3.	Open the store and sign in:
http://localhost:8500/CFSummit2026Workshop/StyleMart/
jordan / Workshop2026!
The database files are already in the repo. The setup page registers them.





StyleMart on CommandBox (port 8080)
Use this only if you are not copying the clone into wwwroot.
1.	Stop any other server already using port 8080.
2.	In the workshop clone (the folder that contains server.json):
box server start
3.	Paste the key into this clone’s file:
StyleMart\config\openai-key.cfm
4.	Open:
http://127.0.0.1:8080/StyleMart/setup/finish-workshop-setup.cfm
There is no /CFSummit2026Workshop in these URLs.
5.	Store: http://127.0.0.1:8080/StyleMart/
Same sign-in: jordan / Workshop2026!

Training modules
Skip this if the module pages are already open on the classroom server.
Paste the same key into the training clone:
config\local-ai-secrets.cfm
Set application.apiKey. Save. Refresh the module page.

First chat
The first chat after setup can sit for a few minutes while documents are embedded. Wait, then start a new chat.
Do not add ?reload=1 to the agent URL.
